1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,856
What if everyone could see your thoughts?

2
00:00:02,896 --> 00:00:05,954
You step outside, and every head wears a bubble.

3
00:00:05,994 --> 00:00:06,342
Pizza.

4
00:00:06,382 --> 00:00:07,052
Late again.

5
00:00:07,092 --> 00:00:07,633
Cute dog.

6
00:00:07,673 --> 00:00:09,375
And yours, in huge letters:

7
00:00:09,415 --> 00:00:10,924
why is everyone staring?

8
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:13,218
On a first date,

9
00:00:13,258 --> 00:00:14,881
things get awkward fast.

10
00:00:14,921 --> 00:00:16,751
He thinks she is wonderful.

11
00:00:16,791 --> 00:00:18,967
She thinks, don't spill the tea.

12
00:00:19,007 --> 00:00:20,283
Both blush at once,

13
00:00:20,323 --> 00:00:23,539
which is the most honest first date in history.

14
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:27,323
At work, Monday morning becomes a thriller.

15
00:00:27,363 --> 00:00:29,252
The boss thinks, I hate meetings.

16
00:00:29,292 --> 00:00:30,713
Karen thinks, free lunch?

17
00:00:30,753 --> 00:00:32,115
And Dave's bubble reads:

18
00:00:32,155 --> 00:00:32,992
updating my CV.

19
00:00:33,032 --> 00:00:34,453
Somebody coughs politely.

20
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:36,742
Exams are tricky too.

21
00:00:36,782 --> 00:00:38,521
A student wonders about answer B,

22
00:00:38,561 --> 00:00:40,408
and the teacher reads it instantly.

23
00:00:40,448 --> 00:00:44,181
Cheating is impossible, but strangely everyone's handwriting improves.

24
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:46,586
Poker night is chaos.

25
00:00:46,626 --> 00:00:49,137
Nobody can bluff when their thoughts read,

26
00:00:49,177 --> 00:00:50,230
I have two sevens.

27
00:00:50,270 --> 00:00:54,239
The game collapses into a very friendly conversation about snacks.

28
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:57,942
Try not to think about a pink elephant,

29
00:00:57,982 --> 00:01:00,800
and suddenly the entire town is wearing pink

30
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:02,618
elephants above their heads.

31
00:01:02,658 --> 00:01:05,345
Trying not to think about something is the

32
00:01:05,385 --> 00:01:06,839
loudest thought of all.

33
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:09,076
Here's the twist.

34
00:01:09,116 --> 00:01:11,405
Once everyone sees each other's thoughts,

35
00:01:11,445 --> 00:01:13,110
they discover the same secret.

36
00:01:13,150 --> 00:01:14,758
Everyone is nervous, hopeful,

37
00:01:14,798 --> 00:01:16,690
and secretly hoping you like them.

38
00:01:16,730 --> 00:01:18,110
Almost nobody is judging.

39
00:01:19,350 --> 00:01:21,972
So the whole town gathers in the square

40
00:01:22,012 --> 00:01:23,405
for one enormous hug.

41
00:01:23,445 --> 00:01:25,861
A thousand bubbles float above them,

42
00:01:25,901 --> 00:01:28,728
and every single one shows the same shape:

43
00:01:28,768 --> 00:01:30,024
a small, shy heart.
